/Subject (The MC33275 series are micropower low dropout voltage regulators available in a wide variety of output voltages as well as packages, SOT-223, SOP-8, DPAK, and DFN 4x4 surface mount packages. These devices feature a very low quiescent current and are capable of supplying output currents up to 300 mA. Internal current and thermal limiting protection are provided by the presence of a short circuit at the output and an internal thermal shutdown circuit.)
/Title (MC33275 - Voltage Regulator - Low Dropout 300 mA)
>>
